  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Strengthening Capacities for Peace and Reconciliation in Somali regional state and Somali-Oromo border communities project in Ethiopia, implemented by Conciliation Resources (CR), aims to promote Peace and reconciliation efforts. The objective of the grant is promoting and sustaining inclusive political dialogue processes and institutions.  , supporting Women and youth to participate, and influence the political and reconciliation processes.  Key activities include provision of technical and logistical support to intra-political parties and civic and women&#x2019;s dialogue platforms.</narrative>
  </description>
